# Judge3-6-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:私は昨晩、<br>ナノカさんが隠れてる<br>倉庫に行ったんです。|#0103Trial06_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:だって、<br>銃を持ってたら<br>また殺人が起きちゃうかも<br>しれませんしね！<br>事前に防ぐのも<br>名探偵のお仕事ですっ！|#0103Trial06_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; 驚愕

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmR2,ArmL9,Eyes1_Flushed_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Closed2,Sweat1_1,Pale1_1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:あなた、<br>なんて余計な事を……！|#0103Trial06_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:まあまあ！<br>いいじゃないですか！<br>事件には関係ない事ですし！|#0103Trial06_Sherry003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆珍しく感情が漏れてる。ちょっとコメディチックなツッコミ
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Angry1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Sweat1_1,Pale1_1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:私はその時の怪我で、<br>今も右手が<br>使えないんだけど……！？|#0103Trial06_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal2,ArmR12_2,ArmL13,Eyes2_Surprised_Open1,Mouth2_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ええ……！？<br>だ、大丈夫ですか……！？<br>あとで治療しますね……！|#0103Trial06_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:私も左足が動きませんから、<br>お互い様ですね！|#0103Trial06_Sherry004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:もうこいつが犯人で<br>いんじゃね……？|#0103Trial06_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆怒り
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そんなこと<br>ありませんってばー！<br>私にも密室は<br>突破できませんよ～！|#0103Trial06_Sherry005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:たしかにそこが<br>解決されないと、<br>シェリーちゃんだけじゃなく<br>誰にも犯行は<br>できなかった事になるわ。|#0103Trial06_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"ならそこの怪力ゴリラが<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_06_01\">鍵を壊して</link>、<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_06_02\">朝までに修理</link><br>してたとかは？|#0103Trial06_Coco002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:たしか……<br>【２時】に大きな音がした<br>とか言ってたじゃん。<br>それが扉を壊した時の<br>音だったってコト！|#0103Trial06_Coco003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR9,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"さすがに素人が<br>んなことしたら<br>直したとき<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_06_03\">バレる</link>だろ……。|#0103Trial06_Alisa001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:じゃあお嬢は<br>どうやって<br>死んだってのさ！|#0103Trial06_Coco004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"火精の間には<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_06_04\">隠し通路</link>が<br>あったんじゃないかしら？<br>それでハンナちゃんが<br>忍び込んだとしたら<br>筋は通るわ。|#0103Trial06_Margo002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"ハンナちゃん以外の誰かが<br>ゲストハウスに入った<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_06_05\">痕跡</link>なんて<br>残っていなかったのだしね。|#0103Trial06_Margo003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:たしかにあの部屋に<br>それらしいもんは<br>なかったけどよ……。<br>けどあいつが<br>自殺なんて……。|#0103Trial06_Alisa002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


